598,"end":600,"surface":"李湯","kind":"person","person_id":"c69_2e6_8d9"}],"source_position":{"first_line":125,"last_line":125,"revision_id":2614279,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-100-phase5-sujun","book_id":"b-jinshu-100","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-100-phase5"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126","text":"二月，丙戌，諸軍攻石頭。建成長史滕含擊蘇逸，大破之。蘇碩帥驍勇數百，渡准而戰，溫嶠擊斬之。韓晃等懼，以其眾就張健於曲阿，門隘不得出，更相蹈藉，死者萬數。西軍獲蘇逸，斬之。滕含部將曹據抱帝奔溫嶠船，群臣見帝，頓首號泣請罪。殺西陽王羕，並其二子播、充、孫崧及彭城王雄。陶侃與任讓有舊，為請其死。帝曰：「是殺吾侍中、右衛者，不可赦也。」乃殺之。司徒導入石頭，令取故節，陶侃笑曰：「蘇武節似不如是。」導有慚色。丁亥，大赦。","raw_quote":"二月，丙戌，諸軍攻石頭。建成長史滕含擊蘇逸，大破之。蘇碩帥驍勇數百，渡准而戰，溫嶠擊斬之。韓晃等懼，以其眾就張健於曲阿，門隘不得出，更相蹈藉，死者萬數。西軍獲蘇逸，斬之。滕含部將曹據抱帝奔溫嶠船，群臣見帝，頓首號泣請罪。殺西陽王羕，並其二子播、充、孫崧及彭城王雄。陶侃與任讓有舊，為請其死。帝曰：「是殺吾侍中、右衛者，不可赦也。」乃殺之。司徒導入石頭，令取故節，陶侃笑曰：「蘇武節似不如是。」導有慚色。丁亥，大赦。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"滕含","kind":"person","person_id":"9ef_a32_155"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"蘇逸","kind":"person","person_id":"63b_09a_c6f"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"lrg_cze_g1l_A"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"蘇碩","kind":"person","person_id":"lrg_cze_g1l_A"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"溫嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"韓晃","kind":"person","person_id":"af7_a2c_011"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"張健","kind":"person","person_id":"8f5_74b_457"},{"id":"c-zizhitongjian-094-xiyang-kinship:line126:m0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"蘇逸","kind":"